{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../StoryPrivacySettingsSelectedUsers/", "title": "StoryPrivacySettingsSelectedUsers"}, "next": {"link": "../../bound-methods/", "title": "Bound Methods"}, "title": "StoryStealthMode", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"storystealthmode\">\n<h1>StoryStealthMode<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#storystealthmode\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.StoryStealthMode\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryStealthMode</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.StoryStealthMode\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Story stealth mode.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>active_until_date</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>) \u2013 Point in time (Unix timestamp) until stealth mode is active; None if it is disabled.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>cooldown_until_date</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>) \u2013 Point in time (Unix timestamp) when stealth mode can be enabled again; None if there is no active cooldown.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/bound-methods/index", "Bound Methods", "N", "next"], ["api/types/StoryPrivacySettingsSelectedUsers", "StoryPrivacySettingsSelectedUsers", "P", "previous"]], "